e","value":"{1CD2403A-D401-4725-B8D0-361239144C62}"},"upgradeBehavior":"install","url":"https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/releases/download/v0.12.0/pdfcraft-0.12.0-windows-arm64.msi"}],"licenseUrl":"https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/blob/HEAD/LICENSE-MIT","packageLocalizations":{"en-US":{"author":"Learning Machines LLC","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the PdfCraft contributors","description":"The PDF workbench; an open-source, clean-room reimplementation of Adobe Acrobat, rebuilt in pure Rust","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Tutorials","DocumentUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/tutorials"},{"DocumentLabel":"FAQ","DocumentUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/faq"}],"license":"MIT OR Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/blob/HEAD/LICENSE-MIT","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"The PDF workbench; an open-source, clean-room reimplementation of Adobe Acrobat, rebuilt in pure Rust.\nRead, organize, combine, split and secure PDFs in a fast, native app, written in Rust from the ground up.\nPdfCraft renders PDFs with care for the details that make a page feel right: kerning and ligatures, right-to-left and complex scripts, vertical CJK, colour emoji, shadings, blend modes, soft masks and optional content.\nCombine files merges any number of PDFs into one. Each file gets a bookmark, with its own bookmarks nested underneath. Extract copies the pages you select into a new document. Split divides a document every n pages, or before the pages you choose.","name":"PdfCraft","packageUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/apps/pdfcraft","publisher":"Learning Machines LLC","publisherSupportUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/support","publisherUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/pricing","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/releases/tag/v0.12.0","tags":["annotate","annotation","comment","conversion","convert","ebook","edit","editor","ocr","pdf","read","reader","viewer"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"PDF 工作台；以纯 Rust 全新重写的开源 Adobe Acrobat 净室重实现","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"PDF 工作台；一个以纯 Rust 全新重写的开源 Adobe Acrobat 净室重实现。\n在快速的本地应用中读取、整理、合并、拆分和保护 PDF，从零开始用 Rust 编写。\nPdfCraft 的 PDF 渲染注重让页面看起来舒适的细节：字距与连字、从右到左及复杂文字、竖排 CJK、彩色 emoji、着色、混合模式、软蒙版和可选内容。\n合并文件可将任意数量的 PDF 合而为一，每个文件都会生成一个书签，其原有书签嵌套其下。提取可将所选页面复制为新文档。拆分可按每 n 页或在所选页面之前分割文档。","tags":["ocr","pdf","批注","查看器","标注","注释","电子书","编辑","编辑器","转换","阅读","阅读器"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/support","publisherUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/","releaseDate":"2026-11-06","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/releases/tag/v0.12.0","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"a4a78ef7dd5a1ec000e60392173b33bed55f7cbb","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/PdfCraft/0.12.0/ArtCraft.PdfCraft.installer.yaml","sha256":"b261bb23ec411616528776654a0b6d2be013075366dabfcc5b04626707a92a7c"},{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/PdfCraft/0.12.0/ArtCraft.PdfCraft.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"a399f40c4ee314daec8cc5df22f183ed727af7cd40d750f991e1d6458ef9e22f"},{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/PdfCraft/0.12.0/ArtCraft.PdfCraft.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"8012f47289b85a7985d69853ca23a93e5891e20daf1d80225a9a2edb73633d83"},{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/PdfCraft/0.12.0/ArtCraft.PdfCraft.yaml","sha256":"aaad0c60904760ad6d54f2c3eca154e361e92d0ec629fb9daa96f15a3d1a2f16"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.12.0"}